{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32360","headline":"和赵嘏题岳寺 · 温庭筠","name":"和赵嘏题岳寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎钟细响乱鸣泉，客省高临似水天。\n岚翠暗来空觉润，涧茶余爽不成眠。\n越僧寒立孤灯外，岳月秋当万木前。\n张邴宦情何太薄，远公窗外有池莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}